<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Office Depot raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Office Depot raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded Office Depot Inc to buy from market performer.</p>
<p>-- Office Depot and Staples Inc said Wednesday they ended their merger agreement.</p>
<p>-- Office Depot gained 3/8 to 16.</p>
